Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 01:08:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Carry the developer-options switch after cherry-pick drops
 its merge-only lines

SetShowDeveloperSettings lives in merge 8338fec20c, which cherry-pick
--no-merges cannot replay. This commit is the same content on current
develop so the rebuild can apply it as an integration patch.

Fork-Feature: fork-tooling
